{"event_id": "64d8dee5-93ed-42ef-9339-36873e336ba8", "timestamp": "2026-08-15T03:59:48.734802+00:00", "session_id": "41646371-a13c-4ddc-9787-3cab0c9c94de", "event_type": "tool_event", "objective": "Retry failed step.", "result": "success", "metadata": {"tool_name": "read_section", "arguments": {"path": "README.md", "section_index": 2}, "output": {"path": "D:\\UAEA-phase1-runtime-v1.0\\README.md", "content": "## 2. V1 架构审计结论\n\nREADME V1 的核心链路是：\n\n```text\nInteraction -> Trajectory Ledger -> Reward -> Distillation -> LoRA\n```\n\nV1 已经解决的问题：\n\n- Agent 如何在本地沙盒中产生真实副作用。\n- 如何用 SQLite 记录用户输入、Agent 输出、工具调用和 Reward。\n- 如何把成功轨迹导出为后续训练样本。\n- 如何避免一开始就陷入复杂路由、多 LoRA 和工作流编排。\n\nV1 尚未解决的问题：\n\n- 经验如何从“发生了什么”上升到“为什么发生”。\n- 哪些失败具有学习价值。\n- Reward 高低与认知增益之间如何解耦。\n- 长期记忆与可训练语料之间如何隔离。\n- LoRA 应该固化什么，而不是简单固化所有成功轨迹。\n\nV1 的最大设计缺口是：\n\n> **缺少 Reflection Layer。**\n\n没有 Reflection，Trajectory 只能成为 Memory；无法自然成为 Cognition。\n\n---\n", "resolved_path": "D:\\UAEA-phase1-runtime-v1.0\\README.md", "content_hash": "a37c59df2c0ea70b275cc5a14d0ee0266453648eed7d397abcffe6c7a38d8f55", "source_hash": "c63579f3973725f638875a44ca975ee06a1a1d3a85b0f91c257b0577dde11078", "size_chars": 479, "section": "2. V1 架构审计结论", "section_index": 2, "line_start": 138, "line_end": 168, "section_catalog": [{"section_index": 0, "heading": "0. 当前项目进展摘要", "line_start": 91}, {"section_index": 1, "heading": "1. 项目定位", "line_start": 124}, {"section_index": 2, "heading": "2. V1 架构审计结论", "line_start": 138}, {"section_index": 3, "heading": "3. 核心认知命题", "line_start": 169}, {"section_index": 4, "heading": "4. V2 总体架构", "line_start": 265}, {"section_index": 5, "heading": "5. 数据分层", "line_start": 304}, {"section_index": 6, "heading": "6. Reflection Engine 设计", "line_start": 369}, {"section_index": 7, "heading": "7. Failure Archive 设计", "line_start": 426}, {"section_index": 8, "heading": "8. Cognition Layer 设计", "line_start": 477}, {"section_index": 9, "heading": "9. Reward 与 Learning Value", "line_start": 525}, {"section_index": 10,